{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "147", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "strong feelings about an issue, like something related to politics, education, or", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.826077001571605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "social trends, you might want to jump at the chance to explain your side and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8260915601150453, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "debate with others. Also, I'd say if you're the type of person who wants your voice", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8260336335161456, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to be heard by a wider audience or even influence public opinion, it's also a great", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.825968325120572, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "idea to take part in a discussion show, where, you know, you can get a mic, a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8261909067952822, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "platform to voice your opinion publicly.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.39903796222222015, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31264518020942617, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I'd say people can be influenced in both ways. On the positive side,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.31264518020942617, "w": 0.7656006070707565, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "these programmes often expose you to different viewpoints, helping you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3409755114228675, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "understand complex issues better. I mean, when you hear people with various", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3693058614970052, "w": 0.8261732725032277, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "backgrounds share their opinions, it can really broaden your mind and help you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39763624929253527, "w": 0.8259463847804577, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "become more open-minded. But on the other hand, if the discussions become too", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.826068081900624, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "heated or biased, they might negatively influence you by spreading", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.45429698716220307, "w": 0.8265556905809197, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "misunderstandings or even encouraging conflicts. You know, sometimes people", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.8262079259376137, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "get emotional and say things that aren't exactly balanced, which might lead you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5109824702653579, "w": 0.8261423099671786, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to form incorrect or incomplete views about certain topics.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.597788224045321, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}